          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 font-semibold">線上講座通知</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          【線上講座通知】中期選舉之後：<br />
          <span class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-blue-400 font-semibold">2027 美國宏觀經濟展望 × 個人智能體實戰</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-x-2">
          <span>主辦協同：北美高校聯盟·AI創業公益俱樂部、北卡浙大校友會·浙大智能體、唯愛智能基金會·唯愛智能公益基金會，聯合 AI智能體聯盟</span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Single Hero Image -->
      <div class="my-6 text-center">
        <img src="/images/2026-11-14-macro-personal-agent-lecture.jpg" alt="中期選舉之後：2027 美國宏觀經濟展望 × 個人智能體實戰" class="max-w-md w-full mx-auto rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl" />
      </div>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <!-- Time, Registration & Zoom Box -->
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950/50 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950/40 border border-blue-500/30 rounded-3xl space-y-6 shadow-2xl">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2 border-b border-blue-900/40 pb-4">
            <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check text-blue-400"></i>
              <span>時間與參會方式</span>
            </h2>
            <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/20">公益免費 · Zoom 線上</span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-400 block font-medium">加州時間 (PST)</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm mt-1 block">11月14日（週六）</span>
              <span class="text-blue-400 font-semibold text-sm mt-0.5 block">下午 5:30–6:30</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-400 block font-medium">東部時間 (EST)</span>
