              <span class="text-blue-400 font-semibold text-sm mt-0.5 block">晚上 8:30–9:30</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-400 block font-medium">北京時間</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm mt-1 block">週日早晨</span>
              <span class="text-blue-400 font-semibold text-sm mt-0.5 block">7:30–8:30</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 space-y-2 text-sm">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2">
              <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium">報名連結：</span>
              <a href="https://luma.com/72p758yx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline font-mono break-all">https://luma.com/72p758yx</a>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2">
              <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium">加入 Zoom：</span>
              <a href="https://zoom.us/j/92866329724?pwd=6xecw1xhmpbbnmwJvsdGdoreqvJ3uD.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline font-mono break-all">https://zoom.us/j/92866329724?pwd=6xecw1xhmpbbnmwJvsdGdoreqvJ3uD.1</a>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1 pt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-slate-200">
              <span><strong>Meeting ID:</strong> 928 6632 9724</span>
              <span><strong>Passcode:</strong> 18970521</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href="https://luma.com/72p758yx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-x-2 px-6 py-3.5 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl transition-all shadow-xl hover:scale-[1.02]">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i>
              <span>立即報名 (Luma)</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://zoom.us/j/92866329724?pwd=6xecw1xhmpbbnmwJvsdGdoreqvJ3uD.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-x-2 px-6 py-3.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl transition-all shadow-xl hover:scale-[1.02]">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-video"></i>
              <span>一鍵加入 Zoom 會議</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Agenda -->
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl space-y-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">📋 講座議程</h3>

          <div class="space-y-3 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800/90">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-400">議程一 · 宏觀視野</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/20">30 分鐘</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">1. Tracy Li 李泉：中期選舉之後——2027 美國宏觀經濟走勢與預測</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm md:text-base text-slate-200 pl-1">
              <li>• 中期選舉改變了什麼</li>
              <li>• 當前經濟體檢：增長、就業、通脹、美聯儲、債市</li>
              <li>• 2027 經濟展望</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800/90">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-400">議程二 · 技術實踐</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/20">約 30 分鐘</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Michael HUO 霍明旭：個人智能體（Personal Agent）現狀與實踐</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm md:text-base text-slate-200 pl-1">
              <li>• Meta Muse、ChatGPT Dot、Claude Duet、Google Gemini、Grok Bot 對比</li>
              <li>• 自託管方案：OpenClaw、Hermes</li>
              <li>• 安全、隱私與合規注意事項</li>
              <li>• StackChan 桌面機器人演示：具身智能與物理 AI 結合</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Speaker Bios -->
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl space-y-5">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-3">🎙️ 嘉賓介紹</h3>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800/90 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="font-bold text-white text-base">Tracy Li 李泉</div>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                東南大學 EE、南京大學商學院、華盛頓州立大學 PhD，史丹佛大學 LEAD 校友。美國金融行業 20 多年，世界 500 強金融公司資深總監十多年。北美高校聯盟北加州分會副會長、AI 創業公益俱樂部副主席。
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800/90 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="font-bold text-white text-base">Michael HUO 霍明旭</div>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Principal Engineer &amp; System Architect，28 年軟體與 AI 平台經驗。現任 LiveX.AI Edge/Security/Compliance 負責人，VI AI Foundation 與 VI AI for Good Foundation 主席，北美高校聯盟北加州分會會長、AI 創業公益俱樂部主席。
              </p>
